<title>USA: Consolidated Stores Sept sales surge.</title>
<headline>Consolidated Stores Sept sales surge.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $181.3     $104.0     +74.3	 +7.0</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $1,228     $801.2     +53.3	 +4.3</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   four weeks ended Sept. 28, 1996.</p>
<p>    Full company name is	    Consolidated Stores Corp.</p>
<p>Consolidated Stores completed the acquisition of Kay Bee Toys in May 1996 for $285.3 million from Melville Corp.</p>
</text>
